rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/26-189.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:189 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sai suka ƙaiyatã shi, sabõda haka, azãbar rãnar girgije ta kãma su. Lalle ne ita, tã kasance azãbar yini mai girma.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Ash-Shu'araa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/26.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 189\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-189.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/26.html\">Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa</a> › Aya 189</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:189</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَأَخَذَهُمْ عَذَابُ يَوْمِ الظُّلَّةِ إِنَّهُ كَانَ عَذَابَ يَوْمٍ عَظِيمٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sai suka ƙaiyatã shi, sabõda haka, azãbar rãnar girgije ta kãma su. Lalle ne ita, tã kasance azãbar yini mai girma.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وجمع لهم بين الثلاثة فإن الرجفة بدأت بهم فأصحروا إلى الفضاء خوفا من سقوط الأبنية عليهم فصهرتهم الشمس بحرها ورفعت لهم الظلة فأهرعوا إليها يستظلون بها من الشمس فنزل عليهم منها العذاب وفيه الصيحة<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 1/126</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s26a189\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-123.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (26:123)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-192.html\">Aya ta gaba (26:192)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/26-192.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:192 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kuma lalle shi (Alƙur&#x27;ãni), haƙĩƙa, saukarwar Ubangijinhalittu ne.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:192 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kuma lalle shi (Alƙur&#x27;ãni), haƙĩƙa, saukarwar Ubangijinhalittu ne.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Ash-Shu'araa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/26.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 192\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-192.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/26.html\">Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa</a> › Aya 192</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:192</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِنَّهُ لَتَنزِيلُ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kuma lalle shi (Alƙur&#x27;ãni), haƙĩƙa, saukarwar Ubangijinhalittu ne.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فجمع بين قوله: {إنه لقول رسول كريم} وبين قوله: {وإنه لتنزيل رب العالمين} والضميران عائدان إلى واحد فلو كان الرسول أحدثه وأنشأه لم يكن تنزيلا من رب العالمين؛ بل كان يكون تنزيلا من الرسول.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/271</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s26a192\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-189.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (26:189)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-193.html\">Aya ta gaba (26:193)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/26-193.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:193 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Rũhi amintacce ne ya sauka da shi.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/26-193.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:193 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Rũhi amintacce ne ya sauka da shi.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Ash-Shu'araa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/26.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 193\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-193.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/26.html\">Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa</a> › Aya 193</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:193</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿نَزَلَ بِهِ الرُّوحُ الْأَمِينُ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Rũhi amintacce ne ya sauka da shi.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي أنه مؤتمن لا يزيد ولا ينقص؛ فإن الخائن قد يغير الرسالة.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 15/221</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وروح القدس هو جبريل كما قال في الآية الأخرى {نزل به الروح الأمين} {على قلبك}<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/519</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s26a193\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-192.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (26:192)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-196.html\">Aya ta gaba (26:196)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/26-196.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:196 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kuma lalle shin, haƙĩƙa, yanã a cikin litattafan (Manzannin) farko.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/26-196.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:196 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kuma lalle shin, haƙĩƙa, yanã a cikin litattafan (Manzannin) farko.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Ash-Shu'araa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/26.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 196\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/26-196.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/26.html\">Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa</a> › Aya 196</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:196</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِنَّهُ لَفِي زُبُرِ الْأَوَّلِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kuma lalle shin, haƙĩƙa, yanã a cikin litattafan (Manzannin) farko.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن المراد بذلك ذكره وكتابته.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/386</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">و &quot; الزبر &quot; جمع زبور والزبور فعول بمعنى مفعول أي مزبور أي: مكتوب فلفظ الزبور يدل على الكتابة<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/386</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالقرآن نفسه ليس عند بني إسرائيل ولكن ذكره كما أن محمدا نفسه ليس عندهم ولكن ذكره فثبوت الرسول في كتبهم كثبوت القرآن في كتبهم؛ بخلاف ثبوت القرآن في اللوح المحفوظ وفي المصاحف؛ فإن نفس القرآن أثبت فيها<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/290</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s26a196\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-193.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (26:193)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/26-200.html\">Aya ta gaba (26:200)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}